lvation!      Charm your way into the hearts of beautiful girls with your wit and charisma! Connect with them through the magical mail — a unique way of communication in this enchanting world. Exchange letters, uncover their secrets and ignite the flames of passion!      To save this world, you must unlock the heart of every woman you meet along the way. Only with their help can you win over the rebellious Demigoddesses. Once you fill them with the Cosmic Seed, magic will flow through this realm once more, restoring balance and ensuring its survival. There's no turning back —The Mistress of Space and Time, the mighty Eternitas, won't let you return home until your mission is complete. So, get ready to go all in. Melt the hearts of these stunning girls and become the hero this world desperately needs!"}